# Lambda checking mode with concrete function type alias.
# [IntFn: [type [Fn@Integer [Integer]]]] defines Integer → Integer.
# [@IntFn [fn [let x] x]] checks the lambda against Fn(Int → Int),
# propagating Int to the unannotated param x.
[
  IntFn: [type [Fn@Integer [Integer]]]
  f: [@IntFn [fn [let x] x]]
  result: [f 55]
]
=== out
["IntFn": ["Fn": IntFn.Fn  "Integer": IntFn.Integer]  "f": [fn [let x] ...]  "result": 55]
